# Registry configuration read by the reusable workflows of eclipse-xfsc/dev-ops
# (scripts/harborconfig.sh): the Harbor project and the robot account name under
# which the application image, the participant image and the charts are pushed.
# The project and the robot account are issued by the administrators of the
# eclipse-xfsc Harbor registry; the robot's secret is the repository secret
# HARBOR_CREDENTIALS (base64 JSON {"<USER>": "<secret>"}), never a file in Git.
# Both values below are filled when the account has been issued.
PROJECT=
USER=
